  message: "Fix merged at dev 9e3a2e7127. Status is pending_validation and NOT satisfied on purpose: the statement is about runtime behaviour on Python 3.10 and this session's interpreter is 3.12, so the matrix leg cannot be run locally. Verified here: the guard imports cleanly, the new gate fires on the reverted defect (naming user_config.py:43) and passes on the repaired tree, the AST walker reaches 417 real sources, and both affected packages now declare the backport. NOT verified: that nightly leg 1 goes green. The evidence required to close is that leg, readable via 'ci-debug cron-status' — closing on 'tests pass locally' would be the proxy-metric closure INV-nufob was false-satisfied on."  # 27d7
